---
title: Periodic elements
tags: tools
heading: "Elements"
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    Convert periodic element property values to different property values, for example atomic numbers to element names or symbols.
    Only a subset of element properties are available for conversion. Strings can be separated using a number of different delimiters: 
    space, comma, colon, semi-colon, and hyphen. You can mix and match delimiters, but they are required.
</p>
<blockquote>
    <p class="ms-2">&mdash; Data sourced from <a href="https://github.com/Bowserinator/Periodic-Table-JSON" class="text-convrtr">Bowserinator / Periodic-Table-JSON</a> under the <a
            href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/" class="text-convrtr">Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
            License</a>.</p>
</blockquote>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden">Periodic elements conversion</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center">
            <label for="{{ filename }}Textarea" class="visually-hidden">Periodic element conversion</label>
            <textarea placeholder="34,7,52,7,58 [Atomic Number] &srarr; Se,N,Te,N,Ce" rows="6" id="{{ filename }}Textarea" class="form-control flip-text" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="mb-2 g-0">
                <div class="row row-cols-2 g-md-0 gx-0 gy-2">
                    <div class="col col-12 col-lg-auto me-2 mb-2">
                        <div class="input-group w-auto mb-2">
                            <label class="input-group-text" for="elementPropFrom">Convert from <span class="visually-hidden">element properties</span></label>
                            <select class="form-select" id="elementPropFrom" autocomplete="off">
                                <option value="symbol">Element symbol</option>
                                <option value="name">Element name</option>
                                <option value="number" selected="">Atomic number</option>
                                <option value="atomic_mass">Atomic mass</option>
                                <option value="melt">Melting point</option>
                                <option value="boil">Boiling point</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="input-group w-auto">
                            <label class="input-group-text" for="elementPropTo">Convert to <span class="visually-hidden">element properties</span></label>
                            <select class="form-select" id="elementPropTo" autocomplete="off">
                                <option value="symbol" selected="">Element symbol</option>
                                <option value="name">Element name</option>
                                <option value="number">Atomic number</option>
                                <option value="atomic_mass">Atomic mass</option>
                                <option value="melt">Melting point</option>
                                <option value="boil">Boiling point</option>
                            </select>
                            <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Change">Run</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col d-flex flex-fill mb-2">
                        <div class="me-auto flex-fill">
                            <div class="form-check form-switch mx-lg-2 d-flex">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="removeDelimiters" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="removeDelimitersLabel">
                                <label class="form-check-label" id="removeDelimitersLabel" for="removeDelimiters">Remove delimiters</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr>
            <div id="elementResults" class="data-to-copy active convrtr-results"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
